0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated benign tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Proximal polyposis of the stomach</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Autosomal dominant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chromosome location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>APC</em> (5q22.2)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">WNT/TGF-</span><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&beta;</span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\"> pathway</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
